# sr25519 mnemonic to deploy Thr33sLeaderboard to paseo-next-v2 over the
# substrate WS (paseo-next-v2 has no public EVM eth-rpc). Its SS58 address must
# hold PAS — the deploy script prints the address; fund it at
# https://faucet.polkadot.io/?parachain=1500
# Used only by `npm run deploy:contract`. Deploy-only, unrelated to any wallet.
# Never commit a real value.
DEPLOYER_SEED=
